Page 3-after line 21 Insert the following and renumber as necessary:
"Section 3. From existing appropriations and from existing employee
positions authorized by the legislature, the state auditor shall transfer two
hundred thirty-six thousand seven hundred twenty dollars ($236,720.00) and two
(2) full-time legislatively authorized employee positions from the department
of administration and information to the state auditor's office on the effective
date of this act for purposes of implementing this act for all state officials.
